OL,3,AFive killed and dozen more injured in
OL,4,AKrakow shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolish police say five people have been
OL,7,Fkilled, and about a dozen more are
OL,8,Finjured, after a shooting in Krakow -
OL,9,Fhere's what we know so far
OL,11,F"Shots were fired in the Main Market
OL,12,FSquare," a statement says, adding: "We
OL,13,Fare awaiting official confirmation of
OL,14,Fthe scale of the incident"
OL,16,FImages show emergency services at the
OL,17,Fscene
OL,19,FPolice say the suspect - who was shot
OL,20,Fby officers - is being transported to
OL,21,Fhospital
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
